hing hunting you grows closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/90bb52841bdd4e11848b61b6c0212859.poster.avif?t=1755170319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/90bb52841bdd4e11848b61b6c0212859.webm?t=1755170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/90bb52841bdd4e11848b61b6c0212859.mp4?t=1755170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths were meant to be buried.<br>Some sins were never yours to dig up.<br>But you keep going - deeper into the walls\u2026 and into yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/0d7c5ef633194d38ee6098a40859911a.poster.avif?t=1755170319\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/0d7c5ef633194d38ee6098a40859911a.webm?t=1755170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843760/extras/0d7c5ef633194d38ee6098a40859911a.mp4?t=1755170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won\u2019t find checkpoints.<br>You won\u2019t find forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll find a door that wasn\u2019t there before.<br>And behind it - something that feels like a memory. <br>Or a warning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 The Forgotten Ward</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ashes of the Damned: The Forgotten Ward</strong> is a psychological horror game about guilt, memory, and the consequences that never stay