u\u2019re willing to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A standalone game in a four-game anthology of psychological horror</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>For Players Who Liked:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you were drawn to the emotional dread and mystery of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silent Hill 2</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amnesia: The Dark Descent</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Returnal</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stories Untold</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outlast</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Martha Is Dead</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...then <strong>Ashes of the Damned: The Forgotten Ward\u00a0</strong>was made to follow you home.</p>",
